{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ( ◦˙ ˙◦ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は昔の写真を漁ってみようかな♡\n昔のオフショット！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これから気が向いたときに\n昔のオフショットも随時公開していくね\\( ˆoˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/05/3077833/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは高3の夏に、\n川後、一実、愛未、まひろ、まあやの\nチームチューリップで夢の国に行った時。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この日、みんなでお揃いで\nツインテールにしたんだよね(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)\n朝からみんなでツインテール！\n若いなあ。元気だなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/05/3077833/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これいつだろう\n高2の冬とかかな？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美彩、優里、ひめ！！\n美彩が髪の毛短い\\( ˆ ˆ )/懐かしい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この写真見せたら、ルージュ愛未に\n口の色がない！って怒られるんだろうな..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/05/3077833/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは埼玉ウォーカーの表紙撮影のときのオフショット！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私がなにかしてるのを\nさゆと真夏が見守って笑ってる写真。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何してたんだろう...\n歌ってたのかな...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/05/3077833/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{